---

## 12) Match Real Layout Dimensions
For each skeleton:
- reserve image height/width/aspect ratio similar to final UI
- use rounded corners matching final cards/images
- mimic heading width, paragraph line count, and CTA size
- preserve grid columns and gap structure
- preserve section container width and padding

