# Expected Decision Rules

## Use Skeleton Only when:
- section is visible early
- section depends on API data
- lazy loading provides little value
- keeping immediate layout visibility is more important

## Use Lazy Loading + Skeleton when:
- section is below the fold
- section is heavy or interactive
- section is not required for first paint
- section still needs a proper placeholder while loading

## Use Neither only when:
- content is already server-rendered instantly and lightweight
- no meaningful loading state is needed
- no performance benefit exists

